<title>HUNGARY: Hungary three-month bill yield falls to 20.78 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary three-month bill yield falls to 20.78 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average annual yield on the latest issue of three-month discount treasury bills was set by auction at 20.78 percent, down from 20.85 percent at an auction one week ago, the Government Debt Management Agency said.</p>
<p>    Total on offer	     5,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total bids received     13,280.92 million forints</p>
<p>    Total allocated	    5,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total issued		 5,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Average annual yield     20.78 pct    </p>
<p>    Average price	    95.0744 pct</p>
</text>
